# A2ML Profile: a2ml/neurosym

@abstract:
Validation profile for the descriptiles NEUROSYM.a2ml metadata record (neurosymbolic
integration / Hypatia scan configuration). Non-executable; five-axis-bounded
per SPEC.adoc Section 8.2.
@end

@profile-def(id=a2ml/neurosym, version="1.0.0"):
required_sections:
  - metadata
  - hypatia-config
allowed_directives: closed [ profile ]
required_directives: []
reference_classes: []
min_attestation: checked
@end

# Notes

@rationale:
NEUROSYM wires the repo into Hypatia's scanning. `hypatia-config`
(scan-enabled / depth / report-format) is the one section without which the
record does nothing useful, so it is required. `symbolic-rules` and
`neural-config` are optional per-project tuning.
@end
